ef63ae642","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20a87a77ef4ee8097bde4069f01436accc6c65dfe7d58bf46a0ecfe8bd2bd8da","logical_entry_identity":"ab6b3e4b01c1879ae89c0032e6efd6a1e859a5001057284fa69b77eb9724b315","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Vulnerable to deadly counterstrikes. Next melee attack will inflict double damage.","source_tag":"_t","target":"容易受到致命的反击。下一次近战攻击将造成双倍伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"735769e754767eb220ca6f6e11c5ad59727757a9b141920909a362ffabd20cc3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20a919e7a86d533295a7812e633328edb92e3c09ecdce13ac0428968b9505200","logical_entry_identity":"5d6f57aeceb499b5e8a88ad926d1bda6db111a11d35733720fa35bf36a66c3fd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Air currents swirl around this bright blue jewel.","source_tag":"_t","target":"空气在这块亮蓝色宝石周围旋转。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d08653dfc34d494abfcc1e4fa7328d1a9a2c18901a3943de67de8e457c8d8751","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20a9ff4dae9c483e194b32a406ffe33a54d90ce864e03e67d57f4aa329f7215f","logical_entry_identity":"a2bd2739d4fd48907730c438513ce8a6a8d93edd0f6198b69adee4203e32ea82","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"hornet swarm","source_tag":"entity name","target":"黄蜂群"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"95b28aaa452d623b66d714232c2b055b8f90e1deb5a659b4737e119ce6ea1b9c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20aa23b10d266c9d69cfb21d9935fb21190eb97a4d52224f5c630f6b3a1d87e5","logical_entry_identity":"625607e0c60bf11df6ed72ae17e76cc5fb9c08920045567f3233ccdbf0551136","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Every power has a dark side, including the arcane forces.\nCorruptors are mages that deal in dark, blighted, demonic magic to attain their goals.\nNot all of them are evil, though; some are simply selfish and concerned only with their own power.\n\nYou have been taught their ways by the Grand Corruptor and can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Corruptor class#WHITE#.\n\nCorruptors are spellcasters, ranged attackers using magic.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Plague your foes with deadly and contagious diseases\n- Hex and curse your foes, hindering and withering them away\n- Sap the life of your victims to heal yourself\n- Master demonic energies to burn and destroy. You can even summon a part of the demon plane, the Fearscape, to trap your foes.#WHITE#\n\nCorruptors use \"vim\" to power their special abilities.\nVim is the life force of all beings. It does not regenerate, and can only be stolen from your foes.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"所有的力量都有其黑暗的一面，包括奥术。\n腐化者是使用黑暗、枯萎和恶魔法术来达到目的法师。\n并非所有的腐化者都是邪恶的，有些人只是单纯自私地只关心其个人力量而已。\n\n大腐化者教会了你堕落系法术，现在你可以在创建人物时选择新的职业：#LIGHT_GREEN#腐化者#WHITE#。\n\n腐化者是使用魔法进行远程攻击的法师。\n职业特点：#YELLOW#\n- 使你的目标感染并传播致命的疾病\n- 对敌人施加邪术和诅咒，妨碍并使其逐渐凋零\n- 从目标身上吸取生命，治疗自身\n- 掌握恶魔能量来燃烧和毁灭。你甚至可以召唤恶魔位面的一部分——恶魔空间——来困住敌人。#WHITE#\n\n腐化者使用活力值来施展他们的特殊能力。\n活力是所有生物的生命力量，它不会再生，只能从敌人身上窃取。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b982b89adb0cc52d3f4300e5bf18c33cc099f8b97f0a56c4ecdcaa1ca36978f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20ab2288383bbe819e1d6bcfafcd8392d0238ccfebbfd6a760c654a753f19b16","logical_entry_identity":"ab2d604569a8b2308c43d0ea73c32e9f41a5abd26a7cc059ac0a5b009648529c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Purge Blight","source_tag":"_t","target":"枯萎净化"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f40afcdca4104429d29c20e1ebcf8b11cfb3cb749df6e1c109abb8c7de016784","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20b1c25a8c49621c9f3b2a3b6080ffb2132ea954e42740f3d55186414dded578","logical_entry_identity":"a8d7ce120a974b1a268435f185c0ca16bc348cfbe2dc75156ff8c8989879bdde","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Show ingredients","source_tag":"_t","target":"显示材料"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0da350a6f0465c6f23a5f1a8b4894a776b1014af7797a777d8f93dc11b4b45cc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"20b2893d7195f88dc3cb032e75df0eb6e99aee5f5506ecb24c11a6cbe8a54489","logical_entry_identity":"a7185ea03efce6c89214266603a86baa9d585f26a3ec5ff41